<title>FRANCE: RALLYING-TOUR OF CORSICA LEADING PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-TOUR OF CORSICA LEADING PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>AJACCIO, Corsica 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>Tour of Corsica world championship rally after 14 timed stages</p>
<p>on Wednesday :</p>
<p> 1. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford Escort  three hours 19 minutes 44</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p> 2. Francois Delecour (France) Peugeot 306    3:19:46</p>
<p> 3. Gilles Panizzi (France) Peugeot 306	 3:19:51</p>
<p> 4. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru Impreza	3:20:04</p>
<p> 5. Piero Liatti (Italy) Subaru Impreza	 3:21:17</p>
